## Closed workaround tickets

Jira tickets that are closed but still tagged on DCI jobs applying a workaround (`workarounds` ≥ 1) during the period. The workaround is likely no longer needed and can be removed.

{% if wa_rows %}
| Ticket | Summary | Status (Resolution) | Resolved | Jobs | Last Seen | Labs |
| ------ | ------- | ------------------- | -------- | ---- | --------- | ---- |
{% for b in wa_rows | sort(attribute="doc_count", reverse=true) %}
{%   set t = closed_wa[b.key] %}
{%   set labs = b.get("labs", {}).get("names", {}).get("buckets", []) | map(attribute="key") | join(", ") %}
| {{ b.key | jira_link }} | {{ t.summary | truncate(60) | md_cell }} | {{ t.status }}{% if t.resolution %} ({{ t.resolution }}){% endif %} | {{ (t.resolutiondate or "")[:10] }} | {{ b.doc_count }} | {{ (b.get("last_seen", {}).get("value_as_string") or "")[:10] }} | {{ labs | md_cell }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
