{% endif %}

## Closed bugs still referenced by tests

Jira tickets that are closed but still referenced by a testcase `ticket` property in DCI jobs during the period. The test property should be removed, or the bug reopened if the test still fails.

{% if tt_rows %}
| Ticket | Summary | Status (Resolution) | Resolved | Jobs | Last Seen | Test Results | Tests | Labs |
| ------ | ------- | ------------------- | -------- | ---- | --------- | ------------ | ----- | ---- |
{% for b in tt_rows | sort(attribute="job.doc_count", reverse=true) %}
{%   set t = closed_tt[b.key] %}
{%   set tc = b.get("testcase", {}) %}
{%   set actions = tc.get("actions", {}).get("buckets", []) %}
{%   set results = [] %}
{%   for a in actions %}{% set _ = results.append(a.key ~ ": " ~ a.doc_count) %}{% endfor %}
{%   set tests = tc.get("names", {}).get("buckets", []) | map(attribute="key") | join("; ") %}
{%   set labs = b.job.get("labs", {}).get("names", {}).get("buckets", []) | map(attribute="key") | join(", ") %}
| {{ b.key | jira_link }} | {{ t.summary | truncate(60) | md_cell }} | {{ t.status }}{% if t.resolution %} ({{ t.resolution }}){% endif %} | {{ (t.resolutiondate or "")[:10] }} | {{ b.job.doc_count }} | {{ (b.job.get("last_seen", {}).get("value_as_string") or "")[:10] }} | {{ results | join(", ") }} | {{ tests | truncate(80) | md_cell }} | {{ labs | md_cell }} |
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
_No closed bugs referenced by test properties during the period._
{% endif %}
